      "type": "text",
      "content": "Dengue: Jun–Oct contains 82.8% of baseline events. ADD: Jun–Aug contains 43.1%, with an October elevation. Malaria: May–Jul contains 51.4%. Food Poisoning: Jan–Feb 26.1% and Apr–May 29.0%. Chikungunya: no stable recurring calendar-month concentration."
    },
